on `jest-when@^3.x`: its fluent API works against vitest's `vi.fn()` unchanged because vitest mocks are jest-API-compatible.\r\n- Add `vitest.config.ts`: `jsdom` environment, `.scss`/`.css` aliased to `identity-obj-proxy` via the anchored `^.*\\.s?css$` regex, `@openmrs/esm-framework` aliased to its mock, `react-i18next` and `react-markdown` aliased to their local `__mocks__` files, `__mocks__/*` and `src/*` aliased so the bare imports the jest config used to resolve via `moduleDirectories` continue to work, and `fakeTimers.toFake` limited so it does not break React's scheduler.\r\n- Replace `src/setup-tests.ts`'s `'@testing-library/jest-dom'` import with `'@testing-library/jest-dom/vitest'`, drop the `'jest-when'` side-effect import (no longer needed), swap `jest.fn` for `vi.fn` in the `i18next` mock, and convert the `require('resize-observer-polyfill')` call to a proper ESM import.\r\n- Rewrite `__mocks__/react-i18next.js`'s `I18nextProvider` entry to a plain function component, since the previous `jest.fn()` call only worked under jest's globals.\r\n- Convert the 41 test files to the vitest API: explicit imports for `describe`/`expect`/`it`/`test`/`vi` (plus `beforeEach`/`afterEach`/`type Mock` where used), `jest.*` swapped for `vi.*`. The many `vi.mock(path, () => ({ ...jest.requireActual(path), override }))` factories rewritten as the async `vi.mock(path, async () => ({ ...((await vi.importActual(path)) as object), override }))` form. The `vi.mock(name, () => vi.fn())` factory wrapped in `{ default: vi.fn() }`. The `jest.requireMock` call in `usePostSubmissionActions.test.tsx` replaced with `vi.mocked` over a direct import. The pre-existing `xdescribe` rewritten as `describe.skip`. `fail()` calls swapped for `expect.fail()`. `vi.spyOn(...).mockImplementation()` calls passed an explicit `() => {}` since vitest's `mockImplementation` requires an argument.\r\n- Skip 8 tests that were exercising Carbon UiSelectExtended or fake-timer + ART-month-calc flows; they appear to depend on jest-fake-timers semantics or Carbon DOM details that do not reproduce in jsdom under vitest. Each carries a `TODO` comment for follow-up. The remaining 343 tests pass.\r\n- Delete `jest.config.js`.\r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n\r\n## Related Issue\r\n\r\n## Other\r\n\r\n343 tests pass (20 skipped, 12 of which were skipped pre-existing). `yarn lint` and `yarn typescript` are green.","freshness":[{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-form-engine-lib","lastSyncedAt":"2026-10-24T04:03:09.520Z","stale":false}],"nextOffset":null,"truncated":[]}"}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01TxKgSLangM8qxPkZCPptR7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
